The Trust Law of the People's Republic of China, Article 60  
For a trust established for any of the following public welfare purposes, it shall be deemed a public welfare trust:  
(1) Relief of poverty;  
(2) Assistance to disaster victims;  
(3) Support for persons with disabilities;  
(4) Development of education, science and technology, culture, art, and sports;  
(5) Development of medical and health care;  
(6) Development of environmental protection and maintenance of the ecological environment;  
(7) Development of other public welfare undertakings.

